```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "list held faces: indices, labels, Handles and chair labels"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.persona.lists", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.persona.lists"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.persona.lists"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.persona.lists ~ the faces this vessel holds

`lares persona list` prints each held face's index, private label, Handle and local chair label. A locked vessel prints the public indices alone; names and declarations appear once that face unlocks. A vessel with no face standing refuses naming the unlock.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ every held face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads this vessel's sealed persona rows; it opens nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 ~ the faces with their labels and claims`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona list]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

